  "description": "An obsession born of love—is it merely obsession, or is it salvation? Han Jin-sung realizes his true feelings only after cruelly rejecting Lee Eun-jae, who once confessed her love to him. Foolishly, he becomes madly obsessed with Eun-jae after she leaves, but her pure, devoted unrequited love has already withered, replaced only by his own immature one-sided passion. With no room for pity, the man is ultimately abandoned by the woman.\n\n**Original Novel:**    \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12030786), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13228176) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13995492)",
